"⟪k:0⟫Think before you act, Georges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What were you doing inviting people like that into "
"our home?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pense antes de agir, Georges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O que você estava fazendo convidando pessoas assim "
"para nossa casa?!"

