msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t think he was especially strong, either. ⟪k:1⟫He was hardly built like Didier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu também não achei que ele fosse especialmente forte. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ele dificilmente tinha a "
"compleição do Didier."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D07D61E7_BE90_4A13_A224_5D00CA7DE1D2
