msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had I always been this feeble?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Were my arms truly so worthless I couldn’t even "
"escape this brute’s grip?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu sempre fui assim tão fraca?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Meus braços eram realmente tão inúteis que eu não "
"conseguia nem escapar das garras desse bruto?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D68A60FE_62EC_46A4_B183_5542CF821C2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 482d2e9b5f9b0f6946af5fb929b01ea01b5e1c3591ba69d56271722af2cc1b43
