#: scenario7:scenario7_477BE831_2C3F_4DA7_A87D_ED9E91533BDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b59d3b484936f634b4dab747bfdd0894e3a65aa9b15c42f2103977aefafd4fb
